pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">및 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">신규추가</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">신청 가능</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><strong>- 2016-2학기 개강일: 2016. 9. 1.(목)</strong></font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\">□ </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">타학년</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">타학과에 개설된 과목 수강신청은 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">교과목코드 직접입력</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">하여 수강신청</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\">- </span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">한국어</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">한국어</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">강좌는 외국인 학생만 수강신청 가능</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\">- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전공에 개설된 과목 중 강의시간</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">/</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">강의실 내역이 없는 강좌는 원격강좌임.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\">□ </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학기 개시후 수강변경 및 수강정정으로 인한 수업 결손을 최소화 하고자 전체학년 수강신청 전에 일부 과목은 수강정원 조정 및 분반 추가개설</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개설폐지 등 교과목 개설 내역이 변경될 수 있으니 확인 후 수강신청에 참고하시기 바람</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\">(</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개설교과목 조회</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학교홈페이지</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">금오인</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-&gt;</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학사정보</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-&gt;</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개설과목안내</span></u></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">원스톱서비스 학부 개설과목 조회</span></u></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\">□ </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">수강신청인원 초과 및 강의실 멀티미디어 장비유무 등의 사유로 강의실이 변경되는 강좌가 있을 수도 있으니 수업 전에 확인 필요함</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-wid